ips.competes_with is empty).\n\nAre other proposals in this same round targeting the same use case? If two teams are both asking for treasury funding to build the same thing, a DRep should usually pick at most one — splitting the budget across competitors normally means both deliver less. This is the proposal's own competes_with declaration.\n# What I need from you\n1. Verdict: YES / NO / UNCLEAR — does this proposal meet the criterion?\n2. Confidence: LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH\n3. A short rationale (3–6 sentences) citing sources you actually checked (GitHub repos, C"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"atalyst project pages, X/Twitter accounts, articles). Be honest if the public info is thin or the proposer's track-record claims need independent verification.\nP…47:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"no-competing-proposals\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[color:var(--border)] align-top last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 pr-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"No competing proposals in this batch\"}],[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"label\":\"No competing proposals in this batch\",\"body\":\"Are other proposals in this same round targeting the same use case? If two teams are both asking for treasury funding to build the same thing, a DRep should usually pick at most one — splitting the budget across competitors normally means both deliver less. This is the proposal's own competes_with declaration.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-sm text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]\",\"children\":\"No other 2026 proposal targets the same use case (relationships.competes_with is empty).\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L34\",null,{\"prompt\":\"$66\"}]}],\"$L67\"]}],\"$L68\",\"$L69\",\"$L6a\"]}]\n6b:Tdbe,I'm a Cardano DRep evaluating a 2026 treasury proposal. I need your help checking ONE specific criterion agains