ince 2021, maintaining a portfolio of interconnected tools that serve as foundational infrastructure for Rust-based development on Cardano.\n\nTxPipe has received funding through multiple Cardano ecosystem programs, including Project Catalyst (Funds 9 through 14) for various tooling initiatives, and Intersect's budget process for ongoing maintenance of Pallas, Dolos, and UTxO RPC. All contracts are on track, with milestones being…\n# Criterion to evaluate\n**Treasury favourability is strong/moderate**\nAI-assigned favourability rubric — strong or moderate (not weak/none).\n\nThe return clause itself is rated strong or moderate (not weak or none). Strong means multiple substantive return mechanisms — price-peg surplus, unspent funds, revenue share — with concrete triggers and deadlines. Weak means vague promises with no enforcement.\n# What I need from you\n1. Verdict: YES / NO / UNCLEAR — does this proposal meet the criterion?\n2. Confidence: LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH\n3. A short rationale (3–6 sentences) citing sources you actually checked (GitHub repos, Catalyst project pages, X/Twitter accounts, articles). Be honest if the public info is thin or the proposer's track-record claims need independent verification.\nPlease err on the side of \"UNCLEAR\" with explanation rather than…51:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"treasury-favourability-strong\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[color:var(--border)] align-top last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 pr-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Treasury favourability is strong/moderate\"}],[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"label\":\"Treasury favourability is strong/moderate\",\"body\":\"The return clause itself is rated strong or moderate (not weak or none). Strong means multiple substantive return mechanisms — price-peg surplus, unspent funds, revenue share — with concrete triggers and deadlines. Weak means vague pro