n can move real assets irreversibly. For…\n\n# Track record claimed by the proposer\nTxPipe is a Cardano-native infrastructure company focused on building open-source developer tooling in Rust. The team has been active in the Cardano ecosystem since 2021, maintaining a portfolio of interconnected tools that serve as foundational infrastructure for Rust-based development on Cardano.\n\nTxPipe has received funding through multiple Cardano ecosystem programs, including Project Catalyst (Funds 9 through 14) for various tooling initiatives, and Intersect's budget process for ongoing maintenance of Pallas, Dolos, and UTxO RPC."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," All contracts are on track, with milestones being…\n# Criterion to evaluate\n**Measurable on-chain KPIs**\nProposal commits to specific, verifiable on-chain outcomes -- transactions, unique wallets, mainnet deployments, TVL -- not just GitHub commits or off-chain deliverables.\n\nJudgment call: does the proposal commit to specific on-chain KPIs that anyone can verify directly from the chain? Strong looks like 'X mainnet transactions per month, Y unique wallets, Z dApps integrated, all queryable via blockfrost or db-sync'. Weak looks like 'increase Cardano adoption', 'community growth', 'GitHub stars', or any metric the proposer themselves controls. On-chain metrics are tamper-proof and let the community measure delivery against the actual ledger, not the proposer's self-reported numbers.\n# What I need from you\n1. Verdict: YES / NO / UNCLEAR — does this proposal meet the criterion?\n2. Confid…58:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"measurable-onchain-kpis\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[color:var(--border)] align-top last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 pr-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Measurable on-chain KPIs\"}],[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"label\":\"Measurable on-chain KPIs\",\"